			"Message": "docs(Rest): Add branding badges, wrap text, restructure funding section\n\nAdd a GitHub stats badge table (last-commit, issues, stars, downloads) at the top of the README for at-a-glance repository metrics. Hard-wrap long Markdown lines at ~80 characters for consistent readability across editors. Convert the funding bar from inline logo images to a structured HTML table with NLnet and NGI0 Commons Fund banners at proper aspect ratios.\n\nAlso normalize em-dash separator characters in the Related Projects links for consistency. No substantive content changes.",
